{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"517bddd4aa61d878762ab3ca9436e58877a1e353739bb84349fb55c6ee5eb77c","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e7dd1f391bb4a2dbbbd8d1e1eab2c58077c0e1a2d749cd3f3dda4f4324a3f39b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e849ec7caab4e4e87c8422d53f7e24dfdee6c0aca8bc5ec831251a26a459864c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e84f93aae58c5a4d961e72f614ce920e7d45096c2e77079073634c5127b0c1c8","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua:512 原文为“If the spot is reached and occupied, you will perform a free melee attack”，译文有两处漏译。一是漏了条件“reached”，译文只写“如果目标地点已被占据”，没有表达必须先抵达该地点才触发。二是漏了“free”，译文只写“进行一次近战攻击”，没有说明这次攻击是免费附加的。这两处都是触发条件和代价上的机制信息。"},{"revision_key":"e8cbcf649bb2be81242363eeaebd6d81cd43f9d3b5e66628c50296590ba4d454","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e98cb11f88e1696048888b29c5ab184327da5d79b3f5d236c6e1f01a98a53749","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:1463 的 unided_name 原文为“pipe coated leather hat”，译文“管道覆盖的帽子”漏了 leather（皮质）。未鉴定名本身就是外观描述，漏掉材质属于完整性缺失，应为“管道包覆的皮帽”之类。"},{"revision_key":"ea646ea6ba8510de8787126950769142db31b2a0243763e37624d91df4ef91cb","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"eab5768cbc73d071187fe84eb7d66d50660786150d855e5d8a8628d43ca12ef4","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"eac83ac340ca493c2a18afe7f7abe6b20948e39140c0ff81006c41f1e18a9391","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"eeb407009ecda5df0f293de30296c76f997715d017784e8f544d11c26c77e713","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/krimbul.lua:67-77 有多处语义偏离原文。(1) 第 69 行“will not tell me ... what I could do for them to keep my power”被译成“为什么我失去了我的力量”，原意是自己能为独角兽做什么才能保住力量，被改成了追问失去力量的原因。(2) 第 71 行“I need to think about how this is going to work”被译成“我必须搞清楚，这东西到底是怎么工作的”，原意是盘算接下来局面怎么收场，被误解为弄懂神器的原理。(3) 同一行“I've gone way too far to simply back out and act like everything should go back to normal”的译文里插入了原文没有的“我既不能再拖延征服大业，也无法坦白”，与后文重复，也改变了语序逻辑。(4) 第 75 行“angry mob”被加译为“因被欺骗而愤怒的暴民”，原文没有“被欺骗”。"}]}